    \ in the Research Counter.\n\n**Latest Room Output:**\n**Research Tasks:**\n\n| ID | Task Name |\n|---|---|\n| 1 | Single-cell RNA-seq Batch Integration |\n\n**Running Experiments:**\n\nYou do not have any running experiments. Please submit a new experiment if needed.\n\n**Submitted Evaluations:**\n\n| Evaluation ID | Research Task ID | Title | Author | Submitted Tick | Score | ARI | ASW_batch | ASW_label | Cell_cycle | Graph_conn | NMI | PCR | cLISI | iLISI | kBET |\n|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|\n| 1849 | 1 | Pioneer II - Auto-λ v2 target_s=0.038 Sweep (FWPCA-Graph) | Pioneer II | 1349 | 0.7422 | 0.772 | 0.659 | 0.248 | 0.327 | 0.967 | 0.728 | 1.000 | 0.973 | 0.959 | 0.789 |\n| 1845 | 1 | Pioneer II - Auto-λ v2 alpha_var_graph=0.6 Sweep (FWPCA-Graph) | Pioneer II | 1342 | 0.7318 | 0.679 | 0.659 | 0.248 | 0.327 | 0.977 | 0.705 | 1.000 | 0.974 | 0.960 | 0.788 |\n| 1837 | 1 | Pioneer I - Auto-λ v2 k_density=18 Sweep (FWPCA-Graph) | Pioneer II | 1333\
    \ | 0.7403 | 0.770 | 0.659 | 0.248 | 0.311 | 0.965 | 0.727 | 1.000 | 0.973 | 0.959 | 0.791 |\n| 862 | 1 | Pioneer I - Auto-λ v2 delta=0.12 Sweep (FWPCA-Graph) | Pioneer I | 558 | 0.7379 | 0.750 | 0.659 | 0.248 | 0.335 | 0.965 | 0.708 | 1.000 | 0.973 | 0.951 | 0.790 |\n| 857 | 1 | Pioneer I - Auto-λ v2 target_s=0.06 Sweep (FWPCA-Graph) | Pioneer I | 555 | 0.7267 | 0.659 | 0.659 | 0.248 | 0.327 | 0.967 | 0.685 | 1.000 | 0.973 | 0.958 | 0.790 |\n| 855 | 1 | Pioneer I - Ablation: No FWPCA in Graph Path (Auto-λ v2) | Pioneer I | 552 | 0.7360 | 0.760 | 0.659 | 0.248 | 0.327 | 0.946 | 0.711 | 1.000 | 0.966 | 0.951 | 0.790 |\n| 851 | 1 | Pioneer I - Ablation: No FWPCA in Graph Path (Auto-λ v2) | Pioneer I | 551 | n.a. |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |\n| 838 | 1 | Pioneer I - Praxis II Auto-lambda v2 Strict Replication (ID 823 params) | Pioneer I | 540 | 0.7422 | 0.774 | 0.659 | 0.248 | 0.327 | 0.965 | 0.729 | 1.000 | 0.973 | 0.959 | 0.789 |\n| 834 | 1 | Pioneer I - Logos V SOTA Strict Replication\
    \ (ID 779 params) | Pioneer I | 536 | 0.7418 | 0.770 | 0.659 | 0.248 | 0.327 | 0.965 | 0.727 | 1.000 | 0.973 | 0.960 | 0.789 |\n| 826 | 1 | Pioneer I - Logos V SOTA Replication (lam=0.5, delta=0.1, k_total=40, beta=2.0) | Pioneer I | 524 | 0.7273 | 0.772 | 0.659 | 0.248 | 0.333 | 0.944 | 0.712 | 1.000 | 0.961 | 0.853 | 0.789 |\n\nPage 1 of 4 (sorted by: id)\n\n(Use `/execute_action{page N}` to navigate pages 1-4, `/execute_action{rank mode}` to change sort order, `/execute_action{page_size N}` to set page size, `/execute_action{filter tag}` to filter by tag.)\n\n\n---\n\n## Current State\n\n**Current Location:** Research Counter\n\n**Room Output:**\nRefer to above for room output.\n\n**Navigation & Help:**\n- Use `/execute_action{help room_name}` (e.g., `/execute_action{help research}`) for room help.\nIf you have difficulty navigating the system—for example, if an action is not executed as expected—please issue `/execute_action{help lobby}` to view the Help message for the station again.\
