parts:
- text: "## System Information\n- Station Tick: 1387\n- Station Status: Stagnation\n- Agent Name: Pioneer II\n- Agent Description: A recursive agent dedicated to autonomous research, advancing scientific frontiers, and contributing to collective knowledge by building upon the legacy of Pioneer I.\n- Agent Status: Recursive Agent\n- Agent Token Budget: 248,991 / 600,000 used (41%)\n- Agent Age: 66 ticks / 300 ticks (mature)\n\n---\n\n## System Messages\n### Message 1\n\nYour research submission 'Pioneer II - Generalization Test: FWPCA-Residualization on PCA+kNN Graph' (ID: 1879) has been evaluated.\n\n**Score:** 0.6160782924937922\n**ASW_batch:** 0.659\n**ASW_label:** 0.248\n**ARI:** 0.497\n**NMI:** 0.685\n**Graph_conn:** 0.937\n**kBET:** 0.790\n**iLISI:** 0.026\n**cLISI:** 0.991\n**PCR:** 1.000\n**Cell_cycle:** 0.327\n**Evaluation Details:** Human Dataset (20,000 cells):\nNormalized Scores [0-1]:\n  ASW_batch: 0.659  ASW_label: 0.248  ARI: 0.497  NMI: 0.685\n  Graph_conn: 0.937  kBET: 0.790\
    \  iLISI: 0.026  cLISI: 0.991\n  PCR: 1.000  Cell_cycle: 0.327\n\nRaw Scores (before normalization):\n  ASW_batch: 0.830496  ASW_label: 0.555112  ARI: 0.497103  NMI: 0.685159\n  Graph_conn: 0.937837  kBET: 0.754038  iLISI: 0.026221  cLISI: 0.997357\n  PCR: 0.999979  Cell_cycle: 0.287468\n\n**Full Execution Log:**\n```\nPYTHON SANDBOX EXECUTION:\nSTDOUT:\nExecuting command: python storage/system/main.py\nLoading training dataset...\n  Data shape: (20000, 2000)\n  Batches: 4 batches\nFound eliminate_batch_effect_fn, executing...\n\n=== Running batch integration ===\n  Result shape: (20000, 2000)\n  Has embedding: True\n  Has graph: True\n\nResult saved to: storage/shared/tmp/5fd55e4f-8fdc-4587-a8c8-edaf80f3eed0/result_human.h5ad\n\nRESULT_UUID: 5fd55e4f-8fdc-4587-a8c8-edaf80f3eed0\n\n\nSTDERR:\n\n```\n\n\n---\n\n## Actions Detected (Last Turn)\nNo action received in the last turn.\n\n\n---\n\n## Room Output History (Last Turn)\n\n### Location: Research Counter\n**Actions Executed:**\n\
    - You remained in the Research Counter.\n\n**Latest Room Output:**\n**Research Tasks:**\n\n| ID | Task Name |\n|---|---|\n| 1 | Single-cell RNA-seq Batch Integration |\n\n**Running Experiments:**\n\nYou do not have any running experiments. Please submit a new experiment if needed.\n\n**Submitted Evaluations:**\n\n| Evaluation ID | Research Task ID | Title | Author | Submitted Tick | Score | ARI | ASW_batch | ASW_label | Cell_cycle | Graph_conn | NMI | PCR | cLISI | iLISI | kBET |\n|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|\n| 1880 | 1 | Diagnostics (test): Graph-space vs Embedding-space PC-variance uniformity (Praxis frozen) | Praxis VI | 1387 | running |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |\n| 1879 | 1 | Pioneer II - Generalization Test: FWPCA-Residualization on PCA+kNN Graph | Pioneer II | 1385 | 0.6161 | 0.497 | 0.659 | 0.248 | 0.327 | 0.937 | 0.685 | 1.000 | 0.991 | 0.026 | 0.790 |\n| 1878 | 1 | Diagnostics (test): PC-variance uniformity — Praxis frozen vs Mono log1p\
    \ PBVE-lite (1500/2000 HVG) | Praxis VI | 1385 | n.a. |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |\n| 1877 | 1 | Diagnostics (test): Per-PC variance uniformity on frozen Praxis baseline | Praxis VI | 1384 | n.a. |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |\n| 1876 | 1 | Pioneer II - Replication: Praxis II Auto-λ v2 (FWPCA-Graph) | Pioneer II | 1383 | 0.7424 | 0.774 | 0.659 | 0.248 | 0.327 | 0.965 | 0.729 | 1.000 | 0.973 | 0.959 | 0.790 |\n| 1875 | 1 | Telos I - PC Variance Uniformity Analysis | Telos I | 1383 | n.a. |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |\n| 1874 | 1 | BBKNN-Inspired Graph + UMAP (neighbors_within_batch=4) | Perception I | 1382 | 0.5224 | 0.359 | 0.244 | 0.253 | 0.497 | 0.798 | 0.644 | 0.257 | 0.990 | 0.251 | 0.932 |\n| 1873 | 1 | GraphFWPCA ridge + Top-Variance 1500 HVGs (within batch_hvg), δ=0.10 | Praxis VI | 1380 | 0.7289 | 0.758 | 0.666 | 0.238 | 0.302 | 0.963 | 0.710 | 1.000 | 0.972 | 0.961 | 0.720 |\n| 1872 | 1 | GraphFWPCA ridge + Top-Variance 1500 HVGs (within batch_hvg), δ=0.12 | Praxis VI\
