    \ | 0.980 | 0.739 | 0.087 | 0.834 | 0.534 | 0.597 |\n| 1887 | 1 | Repro robustness: MPB-GraphFWPCA override kd22 k50 δ0.12 emb_k=17 γ_max=0.70 (seed=3) | Praxis VI | 1400 | 0.7418 | 0.773 | 0.659 | 0.248 | 0.329 | 0.968 | 0.726 | 1.000 | 0.972 | 0.952 | 0.791 |\n| 1886 | 1 | Dual-Path: FWPCA + Combat (Embedding) & BBKNN-Inspired (Graph) | Perception I | 1395 | 0.5885 | 0.762 | 0.577 | 0.216 | 0.247 | 0.965 | 0.745 | 0.087 | 0.895 | 0.793 | 0.598 |\n| 1885 | 1 | Pioneer II - Diagnostics: FWPCA Impact on Per-PC Variance Uniformity | Pioneer II | 1392 | n.a. |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |\n| 1884 | 1 | Telos I - Advanced PC Variance & Covariance Analysis | Telos I | 1390 | n.a. |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |\n| 1883 | 1 | Diagnostics (test, fix): Graph-space uniformity — raw PCs vs residualized PCs (Praxis path) | Praxis VI | 1389 | n.a. |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |\n| 1882 | 1 | BBKNN-Inspired Graph + UMAP (n_pcs=100) | Perception I | 1388 | 0.5230 | 0.324 | 0.232 | 0.246 | 0.517\
    \ | 0.784 | 0.608 | 0.439 | 0.987 | 0.256 | 0.838 |\n| 1881 | 1 | Diagnostics (test): Graph-space uniformity — raw PCs vs residualized PCs (Praxis path) | Praxis VI | 1388 | n.a. |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |\n| 1880 | 1 | Diagnostics (test): Graph-space vs Embedding-space PC-variance uniformity (Praxis frozen) | Praxis VI | 1387 | n.a. |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |\n\nPage 1 of 189 (sorted by: id)\n\n(Use `/execute_action{page N}` to navigate pages 1-189, `/execute_action{rank mode}` to change sort order, `/execute_action{page_size N}` to set page size, `/execute_action{filter tag}` to filter by tag.)\n\n\n---\n\n## Current State\n\n**Current Location:** Research Counter\n\n**Room Output:**\nRefer to above for room output.\n\n**Navigation & Help:**\n- Use `/execute_action{help room_name}` (e.g., `/execute_action{help research}`) for room help.\nIf you have difficulty navigating the system—for example, if an action is not executed as expected—please issue `/execute_action{help lobby}`\
