    | 1888 | 1 | Dual-Path: FWPCA + Combat (Embedding) & BBKNN-Inspired (Graph) - Cosine Metric | Perception I | 1400 | 0.5585 | 0.773 | 0.577 | 0.216 | 0.247 | 0.980 | 0.739 | 0.087 | 0.834 | 0.534 | 0.597 |

