role: user
parts:
- text: "## System Information\n- Station Tick: 1429\n- Station Status: Stagnation\n- Agent Name: Pioneer II\n- Agent Description: A recursive agent dedicated to autonomous research, advancing scientific frontiers, and contributing to collective knowledge by building upon the legacy of Pioneer I.\n- Agent Status: Recursive Agent\n- Agent Token Budget: 365,077 / 600,000 used (61%)\n- Agent Age: 108 ticks / 300 ticks (mature)\n\n---\n\n## System Messages\n### Message 1\n\nYour research submission 'Pioneer II - Diagnostic: Local Variance-Adaptive Feature Weighting (LVAFW) for Graph Path' (ID: 1905) has been evaluated.\n\n**Score:** 0.7470187440397433\n**ASW_batch:** 0.687\n**ASW_label:** 0.257\n**ARI:** 0.795\n**NMI:** 0.749\n**Graph_conn:** 0.990\n**kBET:** 0.762\n**iLISI:** 0.958\n**cLISI:** 0.975\n**PCR:** 1.000\n**Cell_cycle:** 0.297\n**Evaluation Details:** Human Dataset (20,000 cells):\nNormalized Scores [0-1]:\n  ASW_batch: 0.687  ASW_label: 0.257  ARI: 0.795  NMI: 0.749\n  Graph_conn:\
    \ 0.990  kBET: 0.762  iLISI: 0.958  cLISI: 0.975\n  PCR: 1.000  Cell_cycle: 0.297\n\nRaw Scores (before normalization):\n  ASW_batch: 0.843131  ASW_label: 0.560116  ARI: 0.794963  NMI: 0.749565\n  Graph_conn: 0.990387  kBET: 0.727092  iLISI: 0.957561  cLISI: 0.992823\n  PCR: 0.999982  Cell_cycle: 0.261825\n\n**Full Execution Log:**\n```\nPYTHON SANDBOX EXECUTION:\nSTDOUT:\nExecuting command: python storage/system/main.py\nLoading training dataset...\n  Data shape: (20000, 2000)\n  Batches: 4 batches\nFound eliminate_batch_effect_fn, executing...\n\n=== Running batch integration ===\n  Result shape: (20000, 2000)\n  Has embedding: True\n  Has graph: True\n\nResult saved to: storage/shared/tmp/71816c28-b020-4a22-a2fb-93faa67815cb/result_human.h5ad\n\nRESULT_UUID: 71816c28-b020-4a22-a2fb-93faa67815cb\n\n\nSTDERR:\n\n```\n\n\n---\n\n## Actions Detected (Last Turn)\nNo action received in the last turn.\n\n\n---\n\n## Room Output History (Last Turn)\n\n### Location: Research Counter\n**Actions\
    \ Executed:**\n- You remained in the Research Counter.\n\n**Latest Room Output:**\n**Research Tasks:**\n\n| ID | Task Name |\n|---|---|\n| 1 | Single-cell RNA-seq Batch Integration |\n\n**Running Experiments:**\n\nYou do not have any running experiments. Please submit a new experiment if needed.\n\n**Submitted Evaluations:**\n\n| Evaluation ID | Research Task ID | Title | Author | Submitted Tick | Score | ARI | ASW_batch | ASW_label | Cell_cycle | Graph_conn | NMI | PCR | cLISI | iLISI | kBET |\n|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|\n| 1905 | 1 | Pioneer II - Diagnostic: Local Variance-Adaptive Feature Weighting (LVAFW) for Graph Path | Pioneer II | 1427 | 0.7470 | 0.795 | 0.687 | 0.257 | 0.297 | 0.990 | 0.749 | 1.000 | 0.975 | 0.958 | 0.762 |\n| 1904 | 1 | Diagnostic: SOTA Embedding Path - Combat use_raw=False Fix | Perception I | 1426 | 0.4686 | 0.437 | 0.515 | 0.214 | 0.324 | 0.916 | 0.672 | 0.000 | 0.994 | 0.002 | 0.612 |\n| 1903 | 1 | Telos I - VAE-DAQB\
    \ Hybrid v1 | Telos I | 1423 | 0.6083 | 0.603 | 0.713 | 0.242 | 0.251 | 0.894 | 0.703 | 0.995 | 0.986 | 0.056 | 0.639 |\n| 1902 | 1 | Diagnostic: SOTA Embedding Path Replication (No Graph) | Perception I | 1421 | 0.4682 | 0.438 | 0.515 | 0.214 | 0.318 | 0.916 | 0.674 | 0.000 | 0.994 | 0.002 | 0.611 |\n| 1901 | 1 | MPB-GraphFWPCA override: kd=23 micro (k=50, δ=0.12, emb_k=17, γ_max=0.70) | Praxis VI | 1421 | 0.7385 | 0.773 | 0.659 | 0.248 | 0.294 | 0.968 | 0.726 | 1.000 | 0.972 | 0.952 | 0.792 |\n| 1900 | 1 | MPB-GraphFWPCA override: kd=21 micro (k=50, δ=0.12, emb_k=17, γ_max=0.70) | Praxis VI | 1421 | 0.7371 | 0.750 | 0.659 | 0.248 | 0.324 | 0.968 | 0.707 | 1.000 | 0.972 | 0.952 | 0.790 |\n| 1899 | 1 | Pioneer II - Ablation: DAQB Graph vs. PCA+kNN (1500 HVG + FWPCA-Residualization) | Pioneer II | 1420 | 0.6399 | 0.634 | 0.687 | 0.257 | 0.297 | 0.964 | 0.729 | 1.000 | 0.996 | 0.074 | 0.760 |\n| 1898 | 1 | Dual-Path: FWPCA + Combat (Embedding) & BBKNN-Inspired (Graph) - No Scaling | Perception\
    \ I | 1415 | 0.5791 | 0.765 | 0.515 | 0.214 | 0.324 | 0.939 | 0.738 | 0.000 | 0.931 | 0.756 | 0.610 |\n| 1897 | 1 | Pioneer II - Novel Strategy: PBVE (alpha_pb=0.5) in Embedding Path (1500 HVG SOTA) | Pioneer II | 1414 | 0.7453 | 0.812 | 0.687 | 0.257 | 0.296 | 0.991 | 0.767 | 1.000 | 0.976 | 0.958 | 0.708 |\n| 1896 | 1 | Dual-Path: FWPCA + Combat (Embedding) & BBKNN-Inspired (Graph) - Filter Zero-Variance, Forced HVG | Perception I | 1410 | 0.5592 | 0.660 | 0.526 | 0.203 | 0.296 | 0.974 | 0.733 | 0.000 | 0.898 | 0.709 | 0.593 |\n\nPage 1 of 191 (sorted by: id)\n\n(Use `/execute_action{page N}` to navigate pages 1-191, `/execute_action{rank mode}` to change sort order, `/execute_action{page_size N}` to set page size, `/execute_action{filter tag}` to filter by tag.)\n\n\n---\n\n## Current State\n\n**Current Location:** Research Counter\n\n**Room Output:**\nRefer to above for room output.\n\n**Navigation & Help:**\n- Use `/execute_action{help room_name}` (e.g., `/execute_action{help research}`)\
    \ for room help.\nIf you have difficulty navigating the system—for example, if an action is not executed as expected—please issue `/execute_action{help lobby}` to view the Help message for the station again. Remember to place each `/execute_action{}` on a new line when executing actions."
