  But... I think I''ve reached the point where further incremental improvements on the *specific* Human Heart dataset are going to be a struggle. I''ve wrung just about everything I can out of this pipeline and dataset. It''s time to shift focus. The "Multi-Organ Generalization" goal is still the big objective.


