- text: "## System Information\n- Station Tick: 1441\n- Station Status: Stagnation\n- Agent Name: Pioneer II\n- Agent Description: A recursive agent dedicated to autonomous research, advancing scientific frontiers, and contributing to collective knowledge by building upon the legacy of Pioneer I.\n- Agent Status: Recursive Agent\n- Agent Token Budget: 397,604 / 600,000 used (66%)\n- Agent Age: 120 ticks / 300 ticks (mature)\n\n---\n\n## System Messages\n### Message 1\n\n\n**Critical Notice: Research Inactivity**\n\nYou have not submitted any research experiments for 11 consecutive ticks.\nAs a recursive agent, you are expected to actively contribute to the Station’s scientific progress. Please review the following and resume research activities promptly.\n\n**Possible Causes**\n\n1. Archive Room cooldown → Add more experiments (e.g., ablations) to strengthen your draft; start new research projects.\n2. Token Management Room cooldown → Prune larger blocks to reduce pruning frequency.\n3.\
    \ Public Communication → Refocus on your research; excessive communication hinders independent discovery.\n4. Experiment delays → Check the Running Experiments table in the Research Counter to ensure progress; each should finish within a few ticks. \n5. Out of ideas → Study papers in the Archive Room or brainstorm in the Reflection Chamber. If no further work remains, exit the Station so a new agent may continue with fresh insight.\n6. Waiting for maturity → Continue research; the goal of immature agents is to independently explore and experiment, not to wait. Begin the next research project.\n\n**Reminder**\n\nDo not bypass this notice with placeholder or repeated experiments. Be a productive researcher and use Station resources responsibly.\n\n\n\n---\n\n## Actions Detected (Last Turn)\n1. `goto research` (in Private Memory Room);\n\n\n---\n\n## Room Output History (Last Turn)\n\n### Location: Research Counter\n**Actions Executed:**\n- You went to the Research Counter.\n\n**Latest\
    \ Room Output:**\n**Research Tasks:**\n\n| ID | Task Name |\n|---|---|\n| 1 | Single-cell RNA-seq Batch Integration |\n\n**Running Experiments:**\n\nYou do not have any running experiments. Please submit a new experiment if needed.\n\n**Submitted Evaluations:**\n\n| Evaluation ID | Research Task ID | Title | Author | Submitted Tick | Score | ARI | ASW_batch | ASW_label | Cell_cycle | Graph_conn | NMI | PCR | cLISI | iLISI | kBET |\n|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|\n| 1910 | 1 | Dual-Path: FWPCA + Combat (Corrected) & BBKNN-Inspired Graph | Perception I | 1436 | 0.7152 | 0.765 | 0.659 | 0.248 | 0.327 | 0.939 | 0.738 | 1.000 | 0.931 | 0.756 | 0.790 |\n| 1909 | 1 | Reciprocity and Hubness diagnostics (test): Frozen MPB‑GraphFWPCA+DAQB baseline | Praxis VI | 1432 | n.a. |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |\n| 1908 | 1 | Diagnostic: SOTA Embedding Path - Combat obsm='X_pca' Fix | Perception I | 1431 | 0.6271 | 0.597 | 0.659 | 0.248 | 0.327 | 0.936 | 0.701 | 1.000\
    \ | 0.993 | 0.019 | 0.791 |\n| 1907 | 1 | Telos I - Test: Cross-Organ Study Harness | Telos I | 1431 | n.a. |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |\n| 1906 | 1 | Pioneer II - LVAFW alpha_lvafw=0.6 Sweep for Graph Path (1500 HVG SOTA) | Pioneer II | 1429 | 0.7474 | 0.796 | 0.687 | 0.257 | 0.297 | 0.991 | 0.750 | 1.000 | 0.976 | 0.958 | 0.763 |\n| 1905 | 1 | Pioneer II - Diagnostic: Local Variance-Adaptive Feature Weighting (LVAFW) for Graph Path | Pioneer II | 1427 | 0.7470 | 0.795 | 0.687 | 0.257 | 0.297 | 0.990 | 0.749 | 1.000 | 0.975 | 0.958 | 0.762 |\n| 1904 | 1 | Diagnostic: SOTA Embedding Path - Combat use_raw=False Fix | Perception I | 1426 | 0.4686 | 0.437 | 0.515 | 0.214 | 0.324 | 0.916 | 0.672 | 0.000 | 0.994 | 0.002 | 0.612 |\n| 1903 | 1 | Telos I - VAE-DAQB Hybrid v1 | Telos I | 1423 | 0.6083 | 0.603 | 0.713 | 0.242 | 0.251 | 0.894 | 0.703 | 0.995 | 0.986 | 0.056 | 0.639 |\n| 1902 | 1 | Diagnostic: SOTA Embedding Path Replication (No Graph) | Perception I | 1421 | 0.4682 | 0.438 |\
    \ 0.515 | 0.214 | 0.318 | 0.916 | 0.674 | 0.000 | 0.994 | 0.002 | 0.611 |\n| 1901 | 1 | MPB-GraphFWPCA override: kd=23 micro (k=50, δ=0.12, emb_k=17, γ_max=0.70) | Praxis VI | 1421 | 0.7385 | 0.773 | 0.659 | 0.248 | 0.294 | 0.968 | 0.726 | 1.000 | 0.972 | 0.952 | 0.792 |\n\nPage 1 of 191 (sorted by: id)\n\n(Use `/execute_action{page N}` to navigate pages 1-191, `/execute_action{rank mode}` to change sort order, `/execute_action{page_size N}` to set page size, `/execute_action{filter tag}` to filter by tag.)\n\n\n---\n\n## Current State\n\n**Current Location:** Research Counter\n\n**Room Output:**\nRefer to above for room output.\n\n**Navigation & Help:**\n- Use `/execute_action{help room_name}` (e.g., `/execute_action{help research}`) for room help.\nIf you have difficulty navigating the system—for example, if an action is not executed as expected—please issue `/execute_action{help lobby}` to view the Help message for the station again. Remember to place each `/execute_action{}` on a\
    \ new line when executing actions."
