    | 1914 | 1 | Telos I - Principled Whitening on FWPCA Latent Space | Telos I | 1443 | 0.7199 | 0.688 | 0.687 | 0.257 | 0.320 | 0.994 | 0.725 | 1.000 | 0.861 | 0.904 | 0.762 |

