    \ FWPCA + Combat & Auto-lambda v2 Residualization + DAQB-pQ Graph (1500 HVG) | Perception I | 1454 | 0.7469 | 0.793 | 0.687 | 0.257 | 0.291 | 0.991 | 0.754 | 1.000 | 0.976 | 0.958 | 0.762 |\n| 1920 | 1 | Telos I - Symmetrization Probe (Average) | Telos I | 1454 | 0.6738 | 0.813 | 0.687 | 0.257 | 0.313 | 0.950 | 0.781 | 1.000 | 0.961 | 0.214 | 0.762 |\n| 1919 | 1 | Dual-Path: FWPCA + Combat (Corrected) & Auto-lambda v2 Residualization + DAQB-pQ Graph (Resubmit) | Perception I | 1449 | 0.7407 | 0.764 | 0.659 | 0.248 | 0.327 | 0.966 | 0.721 | 1.000 | 0.974 | 0.959 | 0.789 |\n| 1918 | 1 | Pioneer II - Diagnostic: Simplified GNN for Batch Integration | Pioneer II | 1448 | 0.4945 | 0.567 | 0.429 | 0.255 | 0.369 | 0.805 | 0.688 | 0.000 | 0.995 | 0.014 | 0.825 |\n| 1917 | 1 | Dual-Path: FWPCA + Combat (Corrected) & Auto-lambda v2 Residualization + DAQB-pQ Graph | Perception I | 1447 | n.a. |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |\n| 1916 | 1 | Praxis: DAQB baseline + reciprocity-friendly cap (cap=250,\
