    \ 0.965  kBET: 0.643  iLISI: 0.957  cLISI: 0.973\n  PCR: 1.000  Cell_cycle: 0.290\n\nRaw Scores (before normalization):\n  ASW_batch: 0.841185  ASW_label: 0.554264  ARI: 0.749865  NMI: 0.706412\n  Graph_conn: 0.965735  kBET: 0.615746  iLISI: 0.957336  cLISI: 0.992186\n  PCR: 0.999971  Cell_cycle: 0.256561\n\n**Full Execution Log:**\n```\nPYTHON SANDBOX EXECUTION:\nSTDOUT:\nExecuting command: python storage/system/main.py\nLoading training dataset...\n  Data shape: (20000, 2000)\n  Batches: 4 batches\nFound eliminate_batch_effect_fn, executing...\n\n=== Running batch integration ===\n  Result shape: (20000, 2000)\n  Has embedding: True\n  Has graph: True\n\nResult saved to: storage/shared/tmp/e9957f3b-d09d-4579-a425-d3754ffe660a/result_human.h5ad\n\nRESULT_UUID: e9957f3b-d09d-4579-a425-d3754ffe660a\n\n\nSTDERR:\n\n```\n### Message 2\n\n**Automatic System Tips**\nThe Public Memory Room or Archive Room is not intended for sharing unverified hypotheses or detailed exchanges. Only present\
