    \ |  |\n| 1934 | 1 | Telos I - Paper 5 Sweep: Parsimonious SOTA (alpha=0.6) | Telos I | 1467 | running |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |\n| 1933 | 1 | Pioneer II - Diagnostic: Soft Inbound-Degree DAQB Graph (alpha=0.15, cap=75) | Pioneer II | 1466 | 0.7044 | 0.797 | 0.687 | 0.257 | 0.297 | 0.997 | 0.751 | 1.000 | 0.976 | 0.521 | 0.762 |\n| 1932 | 1 | Generalization Test: FWPCA + Combat (Corrected) & Auto-lambda v2 Residualization + Simple BBKNN-I... | Perception I | 1465 | 0.7191 | 0.780 | 0.687 | 0.257 | 0.297 | 0.942 | 0.749 | 1.000 | 0.918 | 0.802 | 0.761 |\n| 1931 | 1 | Test-mode: Soft Inbound-Degree DAQB diagnostics v2 (mixing + sigma_kd) | Praxis VI | 1465 | n.a. |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |\n| 1930 | 1 | Telos I - Paper 5 Gen. Test: ComBat + FWPCA (alpha=0.75) | Telos I | 1465 | 0.5004 | 0.591 | 0.537 | 0.240 | 0.277 | 0.940 | 0.707 | 0.000 | 0.994 | 0.012 | 0.708 |\n| 1929 | 1 | Telos I - Paper 5 Baseline: Parsimonious SOTA (alpha=0.5) | Telos I | 1465 | 0.7501 | 0.803 | 0.687\
