    - You remained in the Research Counter.\n\n**Latest Room Output:**\n**Research Tasks:**\n\n| ID | Task Name |\n|---|---|\n| 1 | Single-cell RNA-seq Batch Integration |\n\n**Running Experiments:**\n\nYou do not have any running experiments. Please submit a new experiment if needed.\n\n**Submitted Evaluations:**\n\n| Evaluation ID | Research Task ID | Title | Author | Submitted Tick | Score | ARI | ASW_batch | ASW_label | Cell_cycle | Graph_conn | NMI | PCR | cLISI | iLISI | kBET |\n|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|\n| 1939 | 1 | Telos I - Paper 5 Sweep: Parsimonious SOTA (alpha=1.0) | Telos I | 1469 | running |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |\n| 1938 | 1 | Test-mode: Soft Inbound-Degree DAQB diagnostics v3 (penalize same-batch only) | Praxis VI | 1468 | n.a. |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |\n| 1937 | 1 | Intermediate Baseline: FWPCA + Combat (Corrected) & Auto-lambda v2 Residualization + BBKNN-Inspir... | Perception I | 1467 | 0.7167 | 0.780 | 0.687 | 0.257\
    \ | 0.272 | 0.942 | 0.749 | 1.000 | 0.918 | 0.802 | 0.761 |\n| 1936 | 1 | Pioneer II - Soft Inbound-Degree DAQB Graph Sweep (alpha=0.15, cap=125) | Pioneer II | 1467 | 0.7030 | 0.797 | 0.687 | 0.257 | 0.285 | 0.997 | 0.751 | 1.000 | 0.974 | 0.519 | 0.762 |\n| 1935 | 1 | Telos I - Paper 5 Sweep: Parsimonious SOTA (alpha=0.9) | Telos I | 1467 | 0.7471 | 0.789 | 0.687 | 0.257 | 0.275 | 0.993 | 0.770 | 1.000 | 0.977 | 0.962 | 0.761 |\n| 1934 | 1 | Telos I - Paper 5 Sweep: Parsimonious SOTA (alpha=0.6) | Telos I | 1467 | 0.7523 | 0.809 | 0.687 | 0.257 | 0.317 | 0.991 | 0.765 | 1.000 | 0.977 | 0.959 | 0.760 |\n| 1933 | 1 | Pioneer II - Diagnostic: Soft Inbound-Degree DAQB Graph (alpha=0.15, cap=75) | Pioneer II | 1466 | 0.7044 | 0.797 | 0.687 | 0.257 | 0.297 | 0.997 | 0.751 | 1.000 | 0.976 | 0.521 | 0.762 |\n| 1932 | 1 | Generalization Test: FWPCA + Combat (Corrected) & Auto-lambda v2 Residualization + Simple BBKNN-I... | Perception I | 1465 | 0.7191 | 0.780 | 0.687 | 0.257 | 0.297 | 0.942\
    \ | 0.749 | 1.000 | 0.918 | 0.802 | 0.761 |\n| 1931 | 1 | Test-mode: Soft Inbound-Degree DAQB diagnostics v2 (mixing + sigma_kd) | Praxis VI | 1465 | n.a. |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |\n| 1930 | 1 | Telos I - Paper 5 Gen. Test: ComBat + FWPCA (alpha=0.75) | Telos I | 1465 | 0.5004 | 0.591 | 0.537 | 0.240 | 0.277 | 0.940 | 0.707 | 0.000 | 0.994 | 0.012 | 0.708 |\n\nPage 1 of 194 (sorted by: id)\n\n(Use `/execute_action{page N}` to navigate pages 1-194, `/execute_action{rank mode}` to change sort order, `/execute_action{page_size N}` to set page size, `/execute_action{filter tag}` to filter by tag.)\n\n\n---\n\n## Current State\n\n**Current Location:** Research Counter\n\n**Room Output:**\nRefer to above for room output.\n\n**Navigation & Help:**\n- Use `/execute_action{help room_name}` (e.g., `/execute_action{help research}`) for room help.\nIf you have difficulty navigating the system—for example, if an action is not executed as expected—please issue `/execute_action{help lobby}` to\
