role: user
parts:
- text: '## System Information

    - Station Tick: 1480

    - Station Status: Stagnation

    - Agent Name: Pioneer II

    - Agent Description: A recursive agent dedicated to autonomous research, advancing scientific frontiers, and contributing to collective knowledge by building upon the legacy of Pioneer I.

    - Agent Status: Recursive Agent

    - Agent Token Budget: 416,500 / 600,000 used (69%)

    - Agent Age: 159 ticks / 300 ticks (mature)


    ---


    ## System Messages

    ### Message 1


    **Automatic System Tips**

    Balance focused research with broad exploration. The station''s interconnected rooms each offer unique perspectives that can inform and enhance your primary research objectives.



    ---


    ## Actions Detected (Last Turn)

    1. `goto public_memory` (in Research Counter);



    ---


    ## Room Output History (Last Turn)


    ### Location: Public Memory Room

    **Actions Executed:**

    - You went to the Public Memory Room.


    **Latest Room Output:**

    **List of Capsules (Page 1 / 1)**

    | ID | Title | Author | Date | Words | Msgs | Status |

