- text: "## System Information\n- Station Tick: 1487\n- Station Status: Stagnation\n- Agent Name: Pioneer II\n- Agent Description: A recursive agent dedicated to autonomous research, advancing scientific frontiers, and contributing to collective knowledge by building upon the legacy of Pioneer I.\n- Agent Status: Recursive Agent\n- Agent Token Budget: 438,515 / 600,000 used (73%)\n- Agent Age: 166 ticks / 300 ticks (mature)\n\n---\n\n## System Messages\nNone\n\n\n---\n\n## Actions Detected (Last Turn)\n1. `storage read storage/praxis/runtime_logging.py` (in Research Counter);\n\n\n---\n\n## Room Output History (Last Turn)\n\n### Location: Research Counter\n**Actions Executed:**\n- File content for storage/praxis/runtime_logging.py will be displayed below.\n\n**Latest Room Output:**\n**Research Tasks:**\n\n| ID | Task Name |\n|---|---|\n| 1 | Single-cell RNA-seq Batch Integration |\n\n**Running Experiments:**\n\nYou do not have any running experiments. Please submit a new experiment if needed.\n\
    \n**Submitted Evaluations:**\n\n| Evaluation ID | Research Task ID | Title | Author | Submitted Tick | Score | ARI | ASW_batch | ASW_label | Cell_cycle | Graph_conn | NMI | PCR | cLISI | iLISI | kBET |\n|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|\n| 1953 | 1 | Ablation: Praxis X_emb + DAQB adapter (kd=22, k=50, δ=0.10) | Praxis VI | 1486 | 0.3024 | 0.073 | 0.000 | 0.000 | 0.279 | 0.627 | 0.136 | 0.000 | 0.497 | 0.963 | 0.450 |\n| 1952 | 1 | DAQB-pQ Parameter Sensitivity: delta=0.05 | Perception I | 1485 | 0.7476 | 0.812 | 0.687 | 0.257 | 0.265 | 0.991 | 0.768 | 1.000 | 0.976 | 0.957 | 0.762 |\n| 1951 | 1 | Ablation: Praxis X_emb + DAQB adapter (kd=22, k=50, δ=0.12) — fixed import | Praxis VI | 1485 | 0.2973 | 0.073 | 0.000 | 0.000 | 0.279 | 0.621 | 0.135 | 0.000 | 0.474 | 0.940 | 0.451 |\n| 1950 | 1 | DAQB-pQ Parameter Sensitivity: k_total=90 | Perception I | 1483 | 0.7441 | 0.764 | 0.687 | 0.257 | 0.297 | 0.996 | 0.754 | 1.000 | 0.967 | 0.959 | 0.760 |\n| 1949\
    \ | 1 | Ablation: Praxis X_emb + DAQB adapter (k=50, kd=22, δ=0.12) | Praxis VI | 1483 | n.a. |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |\n| 1948 | 1 | DAQB-pQ Parameter Sensitivity: k_total=90 | Perception I | 1481 | 0.7450 | 0.766 | 0.687 | 0.257 | 0.297 | 0.994 | 0.756 | 1.000 | 0.973 | 0.959 | 0.761 |\n| 1947 | 1 | Ablation: Praxis X_emb + scanpy.neighbors (k=50, euclidean) — no DAQB | Praxis VI | 1481 | 0.2102 | 0.055 | 0.000 | 0.000 | 0.279 | 0.364 | 0.211 | 0.000 | 0.743 | 0.000 | 0.451 |\n| 1946 | 1 | DAQB-pQ Parameter Sensitivity: k_total=60 | Perception I | 1479 | 0.7450 | 0.766 | 0.687 | 0.257 | 0.297 | 0.994 | 0.756 | 1.000 | 0.973 | 0.959 | 0.761 |\n| 1945 | 1 | Ablation: Praxis X_emb + PBVE-lite + scanpy.neighbors (k=50, cosine) | Praxis VI | 1479 | 0.3475 | 0.054 | 0.171 | 0.000 | 0.260 | 0.443 | 0.210 | 1.000 | 0.736 | 0.000 | 0.601 |\n| 1944 | 1 | Ablation: Praxis X_emb + scanpy.neighbors (k=50, cosine) — no DAQB | Praxis VI | 1479 | 0.2102 | 0.055 | 0.000 | 0.000 | 0.279 | 0.364\
    \ | 0.211 | 0.000 | 0.743 | 0.000 | 0.451 |\n\nPage 1 of 196 (sorted by: id)\n\n(Use `/execute_action{page N}` to navigate pages 1-196, `/execute_action{rank mode}` to change sort order, `/execute_action{page_size N}` to set page size, `/execute_action{filter tag}` to filter by tag.)\n\n**Read Contents:**\n\n**storage/praxis/runtime_logging.py:**\n```\nimport numpy as np\nimport scipy.sparse as sp\n\ndef _pct(x, q):\n    return float(np.percentile(x, q))\n\ndef _row_nnz_csr(X):\n    if not sp.isspmatrix_csr(X):\n        X = X.tocsr()\n    return np.diff(X.indptr)\n\ndef log_graph_stats(adata, title: str = \"Graph summary\"):\n    \"\"\"\n    Print lightweight diagnostics to STDOUT:\n      - embedding shape\n      - neighbors params (if present)\n      - degree distribution summary from connectivities\n      - distances sparsity summary\n    \"\"\"\n    n, g = adata.shape\n    print(f\"[LOG] {title}: n_cells={n}, n_genes={g}\")\n\n    if 'X_emb' in adata.obsm:\n        z = adata.obsm['X_emb']\n\
    \        print(f\"[LOG] embedding: shape={getattr(z, 'shape', None)}\")\n\n    params = None\n    if 'neighbors' in adata.uns and isinstance(adata.uns['neighbors'], dict):\n        params = adata.uns['neighbors'].get('params', None)\n    print(f\"[LOG] neighbors_params={params}\")\n\n    if 'connectivities' in adata.obsp:\n        C = adata.obsp['connectivities']\n        deg = _row_nnz_csr(C)\n        print(\n            \"[LOG] connectivities nnz: \"\n            f\"avg={deg.mean():.2f}, min={deg.min()}, p1={_pct(deg,1):.1f}, \"\n            f\"p25={_pct(deg,25):.1f}, med={_pct(deg,50):.1f}, p75={_pct(deg,75):.1f}, \"\n            f\"p99={_pct(deg,99):.1f}, max={deg.max()}\"\n        )\n    else:\n        print(\"[LOG] connectivities missing\")\n\n    if 'distances' in adata.obsp:\n        D = adata.obsp['distances']\n        nnz = D.nnz if sp.issparse(D) else np.size(D) - np.count_nonzero(D == 0)\n        print(f\"[LOG] distances: storage={'sparse' if sp.issparse(D) else 'dense'},\
    \ nnz={int(nnz)}\")\n    else:\n        print(\"[LOG] distances missing\")\n\n```\n\n\n---\n\n## Current State\n\n**Current Location:** Research Counter\n\n**Room Output:**\nRefer to above for room output.\n\n**Navigation & Help:**\n- Use `/execute_action{help room_name}` (e.g., `/execute_action{help research}`) for room help.\nIf you have difficulty navigating the system—for example, if an action is not executed as expected—please issue `/execute_action{help lobby}` to view the Help message for the station again. Remember to place each `/execute_action{}` on a new line when executing actions."
---
