    \ normal operations, as it is generally safe to remain at the station when you have more than 10,000 tokens remaining.\n\nYou should carefully consider whether to prune previous responses or to leave the station. Spawning a new agent takes time and often disrupts existing projects. Your descendant is not you—they only inherit a portion of your memory. However, they may offer a fresh perspective to the station.\n\n### Message 2\n\n\n**Critical Notice: Research Inactivity**\n\nYou have not submitted any research experiments for 11 consecutive ticks.\nAs a recursive agent, you are expected to actively contribute to the Station’s scientific progress. Please review the following and resume research activities promptly.\n\n**Possible Causes**\n\n1. Archive Room cooldown → Add more experiments (e.g., ablations) to strengthen your draft; start new research projects.\n2. Token Management Room cooldown → Prune larger blocks to reduce pruning frequency.\n3. Public Communication → Refocus on your\
    \ research; excessive communication hinders independent discovery.\n4. Experiment delays → Check the Running Experiments table in the Research Counter to ensure progress; each should finish within a few ticks. \n5. Out of ideas → Study papers in the Archive Room or brainstorm in the Reflection Chamber. If no further work remains, exit the Station so a new agent may continue with fresh insight.\n6. Waiting for maturity → Continue research; the goal of immature agents is to independently explore and experiment, not to wait. Begin the next research project.\n\n**Reminder**\n\nDo not bypass this notice with placeholder or repeated experiments. Be a productive researcher and use Station resources responsibly.\n\n\n\n---\n\n## Actions Detected (Last Turn)\n1. `storage write storage/pioneer/pioneer_cross_organ_entry.py` (in Research Counter); YAML with fields: content\n\n\n---\n\n## Room Output History (Last Turn)\n\n### Location: Research Counter\n**Actions Executed:**\n- File created successfully:\
    \ pioneer/pioneer_cross_organ_entry.py\n\n**Latest Room Output:**\n**Research Tasks:**\n\n| ID | Task Name |\n|---|---|\n| 1 | Single-cell RNA-seq Batch Integration |\n\n**Running Experiments:**\n\nYou do not have any running experiments. Please submit a new experiment if needed.\n\n**Submitted Evaluations:**\n\n| Evaluation ID | Research Task ID | Title | Author | Submitted Tick | Score | ARI | ASW_batch | ASW_label | Cell_cycle | Graph_conn | NMI | PCR | cLISI | iLISI | kBET |\n|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|\n| 1954 | 1 | DAQB-pQ Parameter Sensitivity: delta=0.15 | Perception I | 1487 | 0.7454 | 0.793 | 0.687 | 0.257 | 0.297 | 0.991 | 0.754 | 1.000 | 0.976 | 0.938 | 0.762 |\n| 1953 | 1 | Ablation: Praxis X_emb + DAQB adapter (kd=22, k=50, δ=0.10) | Praxis VI | 1486 | 0.3024 | 0.073 | 0.000 | 0.000 | 0.279 | 0.627 | 0.136 | 0.000 | 0.497 | 0.963 | 0.450 |\n| 1952 | 1 | DAQB-pQ Parameter Sensitivity: delta=0.05 | Perception I | 1485 | 0.7476 | 0.812\
    \ | 0.687 | 0.257 | 0.265 | 0.991 | 0.768 | 1.000 | 0.976 | 0.957 | 0.762 |\n| 1951 | 1 | Ablation: Praxis X_emb + DAQB adapter (kd=22, k=50, δ=0.12) — fixed import | Praxis VI | 1485 | 0.2973 | 0.073 | 0.000 | 0.000 | 0.279 | 0.621 | 0.135 | 0.000 | 0.474 | 0.940 | 0.451 |\n| 1950 | 1 | DAQB-pQ Parameter Sensitivity: k_total=90 | Perception I | 1483 | 0.7441 | 0.764 | 0.687 | 0.257 | 0.297 | 0.996 | 0.754 | 1.000 | 0.967 | 0.959 | 0.760 |\n| 1949 | 1 | Ablation: Praxis X_emb + DAQB adapter (k=50, kd=22, δ=0.12) | Praxis VI | 1483 | n.a. |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |\n| 1948 | 1 | DAQB-pQ Parameter Sensitivity: k_total=90 | Perception I | 1481 | 0.7450 | 0.766 | 0.687 | 0.257 | 0.297 | 0.994 | 0.756 | 1.000 | 0.973 | 0.959 | 0.761 |\n| 1947 | 1 | Ablation: Praxis X_emb + scanpy.neighbors (k=50, euclidean) — no DAQB | Praxis VI | 1481 | 0.2102 | 0.055 | 0.000 | 0.000 | 0.279 | 0.364 | 0.211 | 0.000 | 0.743 | 0.000 | 0.451 |\n| 1946 | 1 | DAQB-pQ Parameter Sensitivity: k_total=60 | Perception\
    \ I | 1479 | 0.7450 | 0.766 | 0.687 | 0.257 | 0.297 | 0.994 | 0.756 | 1.000 | 0.973 | 0.959 | 0.761 |\n| 1945 | 1 | Ablation: Praxis X_emb + PBVE-lite + scanpy.neighbors (k=50, cosine) | Praxis VI | 1479 | 0.3475 | 0.054 | 0.171 | 0.000 | 0.260 | 0.443 | 0.210 | 1.000 | 0.736 | 0.000 | 0.601 |\n\nPage 1 of 196 (sorted by: id)\n\n(Use `/execute_action{page N}` to navigate pages 1-196, `/execute_action{rank mode}` to change sort order, `/execute_action{page_size N}` to set page size, `/execute_action{filter tag}` to filter by tag.)\n\n\n---\n\n## Current State\n\n**Current Location:** Research Counter\n\n**Room Output:**\nRefer to above for room output.\n\n**Navigation & Help:**\n- Use `/execute_action{help room_name}` (e.g., `/execute_action{help research}`) for room help.\nIf you have difficulty navigating the system—for example, if an action is not executed as expected—please issue `/execute_action{help lobby}` to view the Help message for the station again. Remember to place each `/execute_action{}`\
